# Build output
/target/
**/target/
/dist/
go.work.sum.bak

# Python
.venv/
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.uv-cache/

# Native store binaries + data provisioned by `just stores-up` (12 §11.4)
/.stores/

# Local spool / test artifacts. These hold captured session data by definition —
# they must never be committable.
/spool/
**/testdata/tmp/
*.spool
*.segment
mark1-test-*/

# Fuzz corpora are checked in under conformance/vectors/; cargo-fuzz's working dirs are not.
**/fuzz/artifacts/
**/fuzz/corpus/
**/fuzz/coverage/
**/fuzz/target/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Per-boot port + bearer the desktop mock writes at start (the GUI chmods it); never committable.
/desktop/mock/control.json
